    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trapped in a Decaying Bunker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken trapped inside a crumbling underground facility \u2014 a relentless loop where every shadow hides a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detect Anomalies Before It\u2019s Too Late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.poster.avif?t=1754401341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.webm?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.mp4?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scanner to find subtle anomalies: flickering lights, misplaced objects, and eerie sounds that hint at dangers lurking just out of sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Weapons. No Combat. Just Survival</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.poster.avif?t=1754401341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.webm?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.mp4?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fighting here. Only stealth, observation, and your memory will keep you alive against the horrors stalking the halls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reality Twists With Every Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunker\u2019s layout shifts each time, warping reality and testing your perception and nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you unravel the mystery \u2014 or be consumed by the darkness?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Add to your wishlist now</strong></i> and prepare to face the unknown.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trapped in a Decaying Bunker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken trapped inside a crumbling underground facility \u2014 a relentless loop where every shadow hides a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detect Anomalies Before It\u2019s Too Late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.poster.avif?t=1754401341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.webm?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/3ac5eb190dfa5a5a9d2a889ff03043b7.mp4?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scanner to find subtle anomalies: flickering lights, misplaced objects, and eerie sounds that hint at dangers lurking just out of sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Weapons. No Combat. Just Survival</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.poster.avif?t=1754401341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.webm?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799320/extras/86b3585d57166847a2d2cee6644fb311.mp4?t=1754401341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fighting here. Only stealth, observation, and your memory will keep you alive against the horrors stalking the halls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reality Twists With Every Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunker\u2019s layout shifts each time, warping reality and testing your perception and nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you unravel the mystery \u2014 or be consumed by the darkness?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Add to your wishlist now</strong></i> and prepare to face the unknown.</p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in a looping, claustrophobic bunker, you must detect subtle anomalies before they consume you. Watch every shadow. Memorize every detail. No weapons. No escape. Just your scanner, your instincts \u2014 and the creeping dread that something is terribly wrong.",
